#, python-format
msgid ""
"Automatically switches personality to \"Aggressive\" below 30 km/h and "
"restores your selected personality above 40 km/h."
msgstr ""
"在車速低於 30 km/h 時自動切換為「積極」個性，並在超過 40 km/h 時還原你所選的"
