#, python-format
msgid ""
"Block lane change assist when the system detects the road edge.<br>NOTE: "
"This will show 'Car Detected in Blindspot' warning."
msgstr ""
"當系統偵測到道路邊緣時封鎖車道變換輔助。<br>注意：這會顯示「盲區偵測到車輛」"
"警告。"

